{
  "name": "Your Order to Books Pipeline, Watched and Self-Healing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - AN ORDER COMES IN FROM EITHER CHANNEL\n\nFaire wholesale and Shopify DTC land on separate hooks and get flattened into one shape, so every downstream step reads the same fields no matter which channel sent it.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "7fe23693-f619-5c7a-8c44-32184cca47d0",
      "name": "Section - 1 - AN ORDER COMES IN FROM EITHER CHANNEL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - THE THREE PLACES IT USUALLY BREAKS\n\nAn unmapped SKU, an Unleashed call that times out or hits a rate limit, and a Xero call on an expired token. Each one gets a gate, and each gate has somewhere safe to put the order instead of dropping it.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 1420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "436b5776-72e2-5c00-a164-1f4424566cf7",
      "name": "Section - 2 - THE THREE PLACES IT USUALLY BREAKS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - CLOSE THE LOOP\n\nThe channel gets the fulfilment and invoice number written back, and every run leaves a row behind with timings, so a slow step is visible before it becomes a broken one.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ad957025-de2c-52d0-89fe-8c40b538f706",
      "name": "Section - 3 - CLOSE THE LOOP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2140,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - EVERY MORNING, PROVE IT IS HEALTHY\n\nA 7am pass over yesterday's log and dead letters, counted and posted. Green means the numbers reconcile. Red names the orders that need a human before anyone has to ask.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "05557424-9d66-5240-83af-26b845847c3f",
      "name": "Section - 4 - EVERY MORNING, PROVE IT IS HEALTHY",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2760,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY\n\nOne error trigger covers every workflow in the instance, so a breakdown announces itself with the workflow, the node and the order id instead of being found days later in a stock count.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "0fa72362-0d99-5806-8f55-c1994a34cf4e",
      "name": "Section - 5 - NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY",
